DESCRIPTION:Weekdays\, Monday\, June 29 through Friday\, August 14\, 12 - 2 
 p.m.\, (No lunch on Friday\, July 3 as the Library is closed for the 
 Holiday)\, Cafe Space\n\nFree lunches are available for children up to age 
 17. Lunches are provided by a longstanding partnership with Toni’s 
 Kitchen. Supplies are limited\, first come first served.\n\n
