SUMMARY:Blondie Held Us Hostage live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Blondie Held Us Hostage is a high-energy band based in New Jersey and New York\, born out of friendship and a shared passion for music. Hailing from the Pascack Valley area\, we’ve brought our sound from local bars to stages as far as Newport\, Rhode Island. Our lineup includes lead vocalist Sam Lagrosa\, lead guitarist and vocalist Thomas Santos\, bassist Jess Grady\, drummer Juan Zapeterio\, and guitarist and vocalist Jeremy Bailey. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
