SUMMARY:Creative Writing Day Camp
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nHave you always wanted to write? Or to rekindle your interest 
 after time away? In this noncompetitive workshop we’ll dive in\, build on 
 our strengths\, and enjoy the process. All writing is done in class\, to 
 prompts. The only prerequisites are a willingness to pick up your pen (or 
 keyboard) and to be a constructive group member.\n\nThis class is a 3-day 
 "camp" that meets on Tuesday\, Wednesday and Thursday of the same week.\n
