 graphic memoirs of the recently deceased Marjane Satrapi\, tracing themes 
 of identity\, belonging\, and displacement. Participants receive a copy of 
 Persepolis\, available for pickup at the Main Branch. We will also enjoy 
 Persian tea and cookies. Part of Adult Summer Reading 2026: Unearth a 
 Story.
