SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThe offic
 ial meetup times are 8 AM and 9 AM respectively. If no one confirms for 8 
 AM but at least one person confirms for 9 AM then we start at 9 AM instead
 . If you are seriously attending any one event then please confirm one or 
 the other start time in the comments so we can all coordinate and have an 
 idea of what the actual attendance will be. You can confirm your arrival t
 ime on another person's confirmation (for 8 or 9) by liking that comment. 
 Regardless of which official start time we use\, you are welcome to show u
 p any other time\, although we are not responsible if we happen to disband
  early for any reason. The 12 PM cut-off time is only a general placeholde
 r\, not a guarantee\, and we may all end sooner or later than that\, depen
 ding on various factors. Plan accordingly and please use the comments for 
 the benefit of our attendees as we try to please as many different time pr
 eferences as possible.\n\n**ABOUT THE GROUP:** We are typically beginner t
 o intermediate levels playing in a friendly\, sociable\, and supportive en
 vironment while not being shy to a little friendly competition. We may ral
 ly freely in the beginning to warm up and then move on to some quick-rotat
 ion matches between 5-7 points. No formal teams here so everyone should be
  ready to both play with and against everyone else who shows up.\n\n**EQUI
 PMENT:** Please be sure to bring your own racquet and water\, as we don’
 t provide those. Also\, I always have some balls for at least one court\, 
 but feel free to bring your own as well in case we need to branch out over
  more than one court.\n\n**DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availabilit
 y and weather. If you make serious plans to attend then please be prepared
  to cancel or adjust our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending yo
 u agree to be fully responsible for your own health and safety. Each perso
 n is responsible to take a break for rest and water at their own discretio
 n.
