SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Book Club (18 ) Tongues by Anders Nilsen
DESCRIPTION: \n\nTongues by Anders Nilsen\n\nTongues retells the myth of 
 Prometheus\, following his uneasy friendship with the eagle that eats his 
 liver each day and his growing desire for revenge on the god who imprisoned 
 him.\n\nCopies of the book will be available to pick up at the BAB Library. 
 \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nThis book club is exclusive for those 18 
 or older\, as some materials may contain content not suitable for younger 
 audiences.\n\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch":MAILTO:branch-events@montclairlibrary.org
