SUMMARY:Astrological Events: Ketu in Leo NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to register.\n\n5 
 months remain in this transit before we welcome Ketu into the Cancer 
 constellation.\n\nWhat you haven't yet surrendered\, may be the very thing 
 blocking your growth. How to meaningfully embrace the letting go that Ketu 
 in Leo asks of us will be the focus of this lecture.
