SUMMARY:Beach Scene Polymer Clay Jewelry Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to sculpt a miniature beach scene in polymer clay! In this hands-on workshop your instructor will guide you in conditioning and shaping your pendant for a keychain or necklace. You will learn how to add texture with with stamps\, tools\, stencils. You’ll also add color with pastels and mica powders to create your unique beach scene. By the end\, you will have crafted a stunning beach scene pendant or keychain – a wearable piece of art to cherish or share. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
