SUMMARY:FBAL presents The Grand Spectacular Community Yard Sale Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:The first annual Friends of the Bellevue Avenue Library Grand 
 Spectacular Community Yard Sale is coming to you on Saturday\, July 
 18th!\n\nIf you have stuff to sell\, why not sell it in support of the 
 library\, and join a community of neighbors doing the same! BYO table or 
 blanket!\n\nSign up in person at the circulation desk at the Bellevue Ave. 
 Branch (cash or check only)\n\nSign up now for the special early-bird rate 
 of $10 per table! \n\nRegistrations the week of the sale will be $20\, so 
 sign up today!
