 ing of each poem there is an opportunity for a discussion of the offering.
  These discussions may be short or long depending on how the group is move
 d. Bring your favorite poem to share with us and be prepared for a good ti
 me with this group. <br><br><a href="mailto:covenantgroups@uumontclair.or
 g" target="_blank">Contact for more information</a><p><br>─────
